"depth": 2, "reference": 13}]}, {"c": 12, "r": 12, "layers": [{"depth": 0, "reference": 0}]}], "script": {"state": {}, "units": [], "structures": [], "events": [{"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": false}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL DURAND", "message": "Lieutenant, the only reason I have not had you executed already is that your past victories have bought you my patience. You disgrace the uniform.", "avatar": "evil_durand", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "startGame"}], "responses": [{"type": "disableMorale", "disable": true}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "Save me! The Federation is everywhere! It's Tucker, he's here! It's an ambush!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Tucker! Thought you could pull off a sneak attack against the finest fighting force this world has ever seen? Led by its finest commander, I might add.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I actually hadn't planned on running into the Major, no. But I think we can make this work, too.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "I'm glad you can be so light-hearted about your impending defeat.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I never take war lightly. Speaking of, Durand couldn't be bothered to come down and deal with me himself?", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "The General has seen fit to send the pride of Akadia to squash you like a bug.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I'll give you one chance, Hayne. Stop following that mad man and join us. He's not the great leader that you think he is.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "I hope you didn't really think that that would work. The General led me to believe you were better than this. ", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Now Major, how could they manage to get such a large force behind our lines so quickly without you noticing? Didn't you see the convoys approaching?", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "There was no convoy. All of a sudden they were everywhere. It was the War Machine! That's how they got here!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "What exactly does this War Machine do?", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "It poops tanks!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "The ore deposits! We have razed their cities... but not their mining centers. The War Machines tap into the deposits and use them to manufacture units. It's brilliant.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "Dibs on the War Machine!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Are you serious?", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "Dibs.", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Rock-paper-scissors.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "Oh, it's ON.", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "You blew them all up again.", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "It's hard to be very precise with the enormous power of Akadian armor. I am not accustomed to capturing units.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "I've got another special assignment, don't I?", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Very perceptive.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "I'll start sifting through the trash.", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "I'm recalling the main force; we need to strike at the center of these War Machine units, especially with Tucker still commanding them. He's clearly a coward, but he is elusive. It's time for a major offensive.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "You mean a Mayjor offensive? I'm in charge!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "No. Not Mayjor. Major.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "Yes! Major Mayjor's major offensive! Score!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Just... just shut up.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "startGame"}], "responses": [{"type": "resources", "player": 1, "amount": 3000.0}, {"type": "disableAllUnits", "disable": true, "controller": 0}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 0, "unit": "Strike Commando"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 0, "unit": "Heavy Commando"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 0, "unit": "Flak Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 0, "unit": "Scorpion Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 0, "unit": "Mortar Truck"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 0, "unit": "Rocket Truck"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 0, "unit": "Stealth Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 0, "unit": "Raptor Fighter"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 0, "unit": "Condor Bomber"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 0, "unit": "Annihilator Tank"}, {"type": "disableAllUnits", "disable": true, "controller": 1}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 1, "unit": "Strike Commando"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 1, "unit": "Heavy Commando"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 1, "unit": "Flak Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 1, "unit": "Scorpion Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 1, "unit": "Mortar Truck"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 1, "unit": "Rocket Truck"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 1, "unit": "Stealth Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 1, "unit": "Raptor Fighter"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 1, "unit": "Condor Bomber"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "controller": 1, "unit": "Annihilator Tank"}]}]}}